message.content:
I've seen the site structure. All 11 pages are consistent. One thing stands out: the 404 page has a "Report broken link" button, but I need to verify whether `app.js` has a handler for it. Let me check the JavaScript and the remaining pages I haven't fully reviewed.

```bash
wc -l site/app.js; grep -n "report-broken-link\|broken" site/app.js || echo "NO BROKEN LINK HANDLER"
```

